    {
      "text": "对微分方程 $u' = -u^2$ 进行变量替换 $v = \\frac{1}{u}$，导出关于 $v$ 的方程，并求通解。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "可分离变量方程",
        "变量替换",
        "倒数变换"
      ],
      "question_type": "变量替换求解微分方程",
      "method": [
        "变量替换",
        "分离变量法"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "进行变量替换 $v = \\frac{1}{u}$",
        "求导数关系",
        "得到关于 $v$ 的方程",
        "求解并回代"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "separable_equation_reciprocal_substitution",
        "template": "$u' = -u^2$ 型方程通过倒数变换化为一阶线性方程",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "完整解答",
          "steps": [
            "令 $v = \\frac{1}{u}$，则 $u = \\frac{1}{v}$",
            "对 $u = \\frac{1}{v}$ 求导：",
            "$$u' = -\\frac{1}{v^2} \\cdot v'$$",
            "代入 $u' = -u^2$：",
            "$$-\\frac{1}{v^2} \\cdot v' = -\\left(\\frac{1}{v}\\right)^2 = -\\frac{1}{v^2}$$",
            "两边同乘 $v^2$：",
            "$$-v' = -1$$",
            "$$v' = 1$$",
            "积分：",
            "$$v = x + C$$",
            "回代 $u = \\frac{1}{v}$：",
            "$$u = \\frac{1}{x + C}$$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kobe-2025-07c5afeba8-q04-practice-03",
      "school": "神户大学",
      "year": "2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "求微分方程 $y' = -(y+1)^2$ 满足初值条件 $y(0) = 0$ 的解。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "可分离变量方程",
        "初值问题",
        "倒数变换"
      ],
      "question_type": "初值问题",
      "method": [
        "变量替换",
        "分离变量法"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "通过平移变换化简方程",
        "分离变量求通解",
        "应用初值条件"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "separable_initial_value_shifted",
        "template": "$y' = -(y + a)^2$ 满足初值条件的方程",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 9,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "完整解答",
          "steps": [
            "令 $w = y + 1$，则 $y = w - 1$，$y' = w'$",
            "代入方程：",
            "$$w' = -w^2$$",
            "分离变量：",
            "$$\\frac{dw}{w^2} = -dx$$",
            "积分：",
            "$$-\\frac{1}{w} = -x + C_0$$",
            "$$\\frac{1}{w} = x - C_0$$",
            "$$w = \\frac{1}{x - C_0}$$",
            "由初值条件 $y(0) = 0$，得 $w(0) = y(0) + 1 = 1$：",
            "$$1 = \\frac{1}{0 - C_0} = \\frac{1}{-C_0}$$",
            "$$C_0 = -1$$",
            "因此 $w = \\frac{1}{x+1}$",
            "回代：",
            "$$y = w - 1 = \\frac{1}{x+1} - 1 = \\frac{1-(x+1)}{x+1} = \\frac{-x}{x+1}$$",
            "验证：$y(0) = \\frac{0}{1} = 0$ ✓"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kobe-2025-07c5afeba8-q04-practice-04",
